<title>USA: 3D Geophysical Inc Q1 net increases.</title>
<headline>3D Geophysical Inc Q1 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.08		    $0.10</p>
<p> Net			    938			519</p>
<p> Sales		     24,699		    7,052</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  11,934		    5,163</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - On a pro forma basis, Q1 1996 net income was $821,000, or $0.07 per share, on sales of $14.36 million. Pro forma results assume all operations were acquired on January 1, 1996.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
